                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 2,
                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Republicans want to slash up to $900 billion from Medicaid by imposing \u201cper capita caps,\u201d limiting funds regardless of growing needs. This would devastate health coverage for millions relying on Medicaid expansion.\n\u00a0\nWe must protect healthcare access, not dismantle it",
