                "reply_count": 3,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Fifteen years ago today, the Affordable Care Act became law, expanding health coverage to millions\u2014including thousands of St. Louisans. As we celebrate this milestone, we must recognize that folks are still falling through the cracks.\n\nWorking families shouldn\u2019t have to ration insulin, skip doctor visits, or drown in medical debt. Healthcare must be affordable, accessible, and guaranteed. That\u2019s the future I\u2019m fighting for",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
                "text_tagged_users_ids": null,
                "text_tags": null,
