                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Just met with @MoHospitals to hear directly from those on the frontlines. Trump\u2019s proposed Medicaid cuts would gut care for over a million Missourians, threaten rural hospitals, and let insurers dodge oversight.\n\nI\u2019ll fight tooth and nail to protect care\u2014not corporate profits. https://t.co/sznLR2HCHW",
