                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Stopped by Affinia Healthcare\u2019s updated Lemp facility to talk Medicaid, and what it\u2019ll take to protect it.\n\nThe GOP spending bill threatens to gut billions from this vital program. That\u2019s a red line. I\u2019m a hard NO.\n\nWe must protect coverage for the families who rely on it. Medicaid isn\u2019t fraud\u2014it\u2019s future. I\u2019m committed to defending it and expanding access across the St. Louis region.",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
