                "retweet_count": 5,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Under the Republican budget bill:\n- 500+ nursing homes face closure\n- 300+ hospitals face closure\n- 270,000 veterans & foster youth lose food aid\n- $1T ripped from health care\n\nMissouri families deserve better than handouts for billionaires and hardship for everyone else.",
