                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 6,
                "retweet_count": 6,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Republicans control both Congress and the White House. If the government shuts down, it\u2019s on their watch. Democrats are ready to work on funding the government\u2014but we will not be idle and let health care premiums soar for hardworking Americans.\n\nIf this shutdown has you worried or confused about what will happen to your benefits, or any federal assistance you may receive, you can contact my district office at (314) 955-9980. My team and I are here to help.",
