                "reply_count": 4,
                "retweet_count": 5,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "We are in the middle of a healthcare crisis\u2014my constituents shouldn\u2019t have to reckon with their President handing out billions to his allies while premiums are on the verge of skyrocketing.\n\nWe raised issues like this and more at my town hall last night. If you wanted to ask a question and didn\u2019t get the chance, you can send it to bell.townhall@mail.house.gov.",
