                "text": "REMINDER: Open Enrollment for 2026 health coverage is happening RIGHT NOW and ends January 15, 2026!\n\nWhether you\u2019re shopping for a new plan or keeping your current one, now\u2019s the time to act. Visit https://t.co/dl6A9xkkp3 or call 1-800-318-2596 to explore your options.",
