                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Reminder: To have health coverage start on January 1, you must enroll by December 15.\n\nLosing coverage or going uninsured isn\u2019t just stressful, it\u2019s expensive. The Affordable Care Act helps millions of working families get quality, affordable health care, including folks with pre-existing conditions.\n\nIf you or your family need coverage for 2026, don\u2019t wait. Visit https://t.co/cfCJX4n8Dw and enroll ASAP.",
